// Final integration scenario for Worldwake.
//
// Purpose: keep the latest survival loop alive while structurally activating
// the full gameplay feature catalog. Earlier roadmap rows already own the
// behavior proof for their individual mechanics; this row owns coexistence:
// the full stack can be authored together while hostile pressure occurs and
// the authored survival-health envelope still holds.
//
// Lawful competing affordances intentionally constrained:
// - one caregiver owns the survival-health envelope; the ward and attacker are
//   supporting causal actors
// - feature-catalog activators are carried by a non-autonomous integration
//   witness so this scenario does not silently re-prove every prior behavior
// - food and water exist at both places so the proof is escort/care under
//   full-stack structural pressure rather than starvation pathfinding
